// P1AM-100: motor start/stop with a seal-in on Productivity1000 I/O modules.
// Slot 1: a discrete input module (or the P1-08SIM switch simulator)
//   ch 1 Start (NO), ch 2 Stop (NC), ch 3 Overload (NC)
